                'solution_en' => 'We constructed the platform around an integrated framework: Discovery, Technical Transparency, and E-Commerce. Users explore specialized clinical departments, filtering down to high-precision equipment with side-by-side comparison tools, wishlists, and cart pathways. Product display pages accommodate granular technical matrices, operational specifications, and regulatory certifications. Comprehensive e-commerce functionalities — including real-time order tracking, flash sales, and inventory management — turn the site into an enterprise digital sales powerhouse.',
