                'solution_en' => 'We executed a user-centered design methodology focused on structural clarity and mobile ergonomics. The solution features an optimized Information Architecture, mobile-first layouts, and an actionable Student Dashboard that surfaces current lectures, upcoming deadlines, and course resources at a glance. Courseware was compartmentalized into bite-sized visual units with accessible navigation. A comprehensive, scalable Design System was created to preserve brand coherence across both iOS and Android platforms.',
