                'challenge_en' => 'Telecommunications enterprise apps operate under intense functional density: merging line telemetry, recurring subscriptions, rapid payments, loyalty rewards, and roaming bundles into a single viewport. The principal challenge was untangling this vast feature architecture into an effortless customer experience without burying core utility. The redesign required reducing visual noise, prioritizing mission-critical usage data, rationalizing service discoverability, and enforcing component consistency across the entire product ecosystem.',
