                'solution_en' => 'We applied a user-centered product design framework that repositions the subscriber\'s real-time telemetry at the helm. The mobile dashboard was re-architected into an active command center where data quotas, talk-time balances, renewal timelines, and active plans are immediately decipherable. Core utility flows — such as instant recharges, data add-ons, digital vouchers, roaming passes, and multi-account switching — were decoupled into ergonomic quick-action paths supported by a unified, scalable Design System.',
