                'challenge_en' => 'Legal practice hinges upon airtight confidentiality, punctual scheduling, and rapid access to client communications. The primary challenge was crafting a professional mobile tool that drastically simplifies administrative friction without encumbering attorneys\' busy daily routines. The interface had to deliver instantaneous visibility into incoming consultations and client requests, coupled with rock-solid reliability for scheduling and document exchange.',
