                'solution_en' => 'We developed an attorney-facing mobile solution rooted in information clarity, rapid action triggers, and operational focus. The experience prioritizes the lawyer\'s daily docket: structuring client onboarding, scheduling calendars, real-time messaging, and consultation requests within a single cohesive interface, ensuring swift response times and organized legal case records.',
