                'summary_en' => 'OxTech engineered an enterprise B2B supply platform for Alex Marine, servicing the maritime, offshore, and industrial occupational safety sectors. Designed around a product-centric architecture, the platform showcases specialized technical equipment including marine deck supplies, SOLAS-certified fire-fighting systems, life-saving gear, mooring lines, and heavy industrial hardware. In addition to transactional catalog browsing, the platform features certified marine maintenance projects, offering institutional procurement managers a streamlined request-for-quote (RFQ) funnel integrated with instant WhatsApp communication.',
