                'challenge_en' => 'Maritime procurement and industrial safety distribution operate under stringent regulatory standards, requiring specialized datasheets, volume pricing, and verifiable supply credibility. The technical challenge was transforming an extensive catalog of industrial and marine apparatus into an agile digital directory that facilitates bulk purchasing and RFQs without the friction of consumer e-commerce checkouts. The platform needed to balance technical depth with instant lead-generation touchpoints for fleet managers and safety directors.',
